# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Pune Urban Heat Framework — GitHub Pages .gitignore
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# GeoTIFF raster files — raw scientific data used only by
# Jupyter notebooks; NOT referenced by any HTML page.
# Excluding keeps the repo at ~28 MB instead of ~192 MB.
# The website functions identically without them on GitHub Pages.
*.tif
*.tiff

# OS / Editor junk
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
*.swp
*.swo
*~

# Python
__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.pyo
.ipynb_checkpoints/
*.ipynb

# Node (if ever used locally)
node_modules/

# IDE
.vscode/
.idea/
